# vaios default configuration (defconfig).
#
# Seeded into <build>/.config on first configure. An empty body means "all
# Kconfig defaults", which reproduces the historical include/vaios_config_
# default.h values exactly. Customise interactively with:
#
#     python3 tools/kconfig.py --menuconfig --config <build>/.config
#
# then re-run cmake to regenerate <build>/vaios_autoconf.h. Non-default choices
# persist in the build-dir .config; commit a curated defconfig to change the
# shipped baseline.
